#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:1
msgid "Runner lease failures"
msgstr "Runner 租约失效"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:3
msgid ""
"A retained sandbox can outlive the lease of the worker driving its turn. "
"Start from the attempt records and runner logs: a container that still "
"exists does not prove that its native session can safely continue."
msgstr ""
"保留沙箱可能比驱动其轮次的 worker 的租约活得更久。请从 attempt 记录和 runner "
"日志入手：容器仍然存在，并不能证明它的原生会话可以安全地继续。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:7
msgid "Lease timing and retries"
msgstr "租约时长与重试"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Attempt lease"
msgstr "Attempt 租约"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "120 seconds"
msgstr "120 秒"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Fences the worker's authority to write."
msgstr "限定 worker 在什么时候有权写入。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Heartbeat interval"
msgstr "心跳间隔"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "30 seconds"
msgstr "30 秒"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Renews that authority on a separate thread."
msgstr "在单独的线程里续期这份写入权。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Heartbeat HTTP timeout"
msgstr "心跳 HTTP 超时"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "10 seconds"
msgstr "10 秒"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Limits each renewal request."
msgstr "每次续期请求最多等这么久。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Retry delay after heartbeat failure"
msgstr "心跳失败后的重试延迟"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "5 seconds"
msgstr "5 秒"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Retries while the current lease remains valid."
msgstr "在当前租约仍然有效时重试。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Agent execution timeout"
msgstr "Agent 执行超时"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "3,600 seconds"
msgstr "3,600 秒"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Limits the turn itself."
msgstr "限制轮次本身最多跑多久。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Ordinary control RPC timeout"
msgstr "普通控制 RPC 超时"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Default for other control requests."
msgstr "其他控制请求的默认超时。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:18
msgid ""
"Renewal does not depend on model output, tool activity or progress "
"events, so a quiet call can span many lease periods. The first heartbeat "
"goes out as soon as the turn's process starts, because the lease runs "
"from the claim. With repeated ten-second read timeouts, retries start at "
"0, 15, 30 … 105 seconds, which leaves chances to reconnect before a "
"120-second lease ends but guarantees nothing; an outage longer than the "
"remaining lease loses it. A successful heartbeat restores the normal "
"interval."
msgstr ""
"续租不依赖模型输出、工具活动或进度事件，所以一次长时间无声的调用可以跨越多个租期。运行轮次的进程一启动就发出第一次心跳，因为租约从认领时开始计算。如果每次都是十秒读取超时，重试会在第"
" 0、15、30 … 105 秒发起，在 120 "
"秒的租约结束前留有重连的机会，但不作任何保证；中断时间超过剩余租期，租约就会丢失。心跳一旦成功，就恢复正常的间隔。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:26
msgid ""
"The runner stops the agent, so that it cannot write to the shared "
"workspace after the reaper has superseded the attempt, when:"
msgstr "出现以下情况时，runner 会停止 agent，防止它在回收器取代这个 attempt 之后继续写入共享工作区："

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:29
msgid "a heartbeat answers HTTP 409: the lease is gone for good;"
msgstr "心跳返回 HTTP 409：租约已永久失效；"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:30
msgid ""
"the control plane refuses the worker credential (HTTP 401, 403 or 404, "
"which no retry changes);"
msgstr "控制平面拒绝 worker 凭据（HTTP 401、403 或 404，重试也不会改变）；"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:32
msgid "its last acknowledged renewal is a whole lease old."
msgstr "距上一次得到确认的续租已经过了整整一个租期。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:34
msgid ""
"A lease must therefore outlast one heartbeat interval plus one request "
"timeout (40 seconds): a shorter `AGENT_LEASE_TTL` is ignored in favour of"
" the default, and a shorter `--lease-ttl` is refused. A cancellation does"
" not stop renewal; the lease is kept while the runner releases or drains "
"the turn."
msgstr ""
"所以租约必须长于一个心跳间隔加一次请求超时（40 秒）：更短的 `AGENT_LEASE_TTL` 会被忽略，改用默认值；更短的 "
"`--lease-ttl` 会被拒绝。取消不会停止续租；runner 释放或排空轮次期间，租约仍然保持。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:39
msgid "Diagnose from positive evidence"
msgstr "凭确切的证据下结论"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:41
msgid ""
"Tell a renewal timeout apart from an execution timeout, a cancellation or"
" the agent exiting. `lease_expired` proves only that the database saw no "
"timely renewal. Missing error events prove nothing: the outage that "
"blocks renewal can block error reporting too. Use these log records:"
msgstr ""
"要区分续租超时、执行超时、取消和 agent 退出。`lease_expired` "
"只能证明数据库没有及时收到续租。缺少错误事件什么也证明不了：阻断续租的故障同样可能阻断错误上报。请使用下面这些日志记录："

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Record"
msgstr "记录"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Evidence"
msgstr "证据"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "`agent_attempt_claimed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Job, attempt, worker and host identifiers."
msgstr "任务、attempt、worker 和主机的标识。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "`agent_control_failure`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Failed operation/stage, job ID, exception class and HTTP status when "
"available."
msgstr "失败的操作或阶段、任务 ID、异常类，以及能拿到时的 HTTP 状态码。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "`agent_heartbeat_retry`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Consecutive failures, time since the last acknowledgement (or heartbeat "
"start), and next retry delay."
msgstr "连续失败了几次、距离上次确认（或心跳开始）过了多久，以及下次重试前要等多久。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "`agent_heartbeat_recovered`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md
msgid "Renewal succeeded after failures."
msgstr "失败几次之后，续期又成功了。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:53
msgid ""
"They carry no request URLs, tokens, response bodies or exception "
"messages, and the exception class and status are logged once per outage. "
"Correlate them with the attempt's `lease_owner`, `lease_expires_at` and "
"event timestamps. Collect runner and control-plane logs outside their "
"containers: replacing a container can delete its Docker logs."
msgstr ""
"它们不包含请求 URL、令牌、响应体或异常消息，异常类型和状态码在每次故障中只记录一次。把它们与 attempt 的 "
"`lease_owner`、`lease_expires_at` 和事件时间戳对照。请在容器之外收集 runner "
"和控制平面的日志：替换容器可能会删除它的 Docker 日志。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:59
msgid ""
"An `attempt_superseded` event does not mean another attempt ran. A "
"retained session can become lost without a replacement, for example when "
"activation ownership was uncertain during preparation. The UI shows "
"another attempt only when its events exist."
msgstr ""
"`attempt_superseded` 事件并不表示另一个 attempt "
"运行过。保留会话可能在没有替代者的情况下丢失，例如准备阶段激活的归属不确定时。只有另一个 attempt 的事件确实存在时，界面才会显示它。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:64
msgid "Reporting and acknowledgement failures"
msgstr "上报和确认失败"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:66
msgid ""
"Event upload and the terminal `finish` request are independent: the "
"runner attempts `finish` even if uploads fail, and the reaper is the last"
" backstop."
msgstr "事件上传与终结性的 `finish` 请求相互独立：即使上传失败，runner 也会尝试 `finish`，回收器是最后一道保障。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:69
msgid ""
"The turn loop numbers, redacts and queues each event, and one sender "
"thread posts the queue in order to `POST "
"/v1/agent/worker/jobs/<job>/events:batch`, up to 100 events or 256 KiB "
"per request. A batch is retried whole for up to 60 seconds on transport "
"failures and HTTP 408, 429, 500, 502, 503 and 504, with delays doubling "
"from one second to eight; the event numbers make the retry safe. Past "
"1,000 queued events or 4 MiB the turn loop waits, so a CLI whose events "
"cannot be recorded stops being read. A 409 ends the turn as a refused "
"heartbeat does, and if the sender gives up, the turn fails before it "
"settles. `finish`, the release and terminal suspend and resume wait for "
"the events queued before them. A control plane that answers the batch "
"route with 404 or 405 predates it: the runner logs "
"`agent_event_batches_unsupported` and posts that attempt's remaining "
"events one at a time to `/events`."
msgstr ""
"轮次循环为每个事件编号、脱敏并放入队列，由一个发送线程按顺序把队列提交到 `POST "
"/v1/agent/worker/jobs/<job>/events:batch`，每个请求最多 100 个事件或 256 "
"KiB。遇到传输失败以及 HTTP 408、429、500、502、503 和 504 时，整批重试，最长 60 "
"秒，间隔从一秒起倍增到八秒；事件编号保证重试是安全的。队列超过 1,000 个事件或 4 MiB 时，轮次循环会等待，所以事件无法记录的 CLI "
"会停止被读取。409 "
"会像被拒绝的心跳那样结束轮次；发送线程放弃时，轮次在结算前失败。`finish`、释放以及终端的挂起和恢复，都会等待排在它们前面的事件。对批量路由返回"
" 404 或 405 的控制平面版本较旧：runner 会记录 `agent_event_batches_unsupported`，并把这个 "
"attempt 余下的事件逐个提交到 `/events`。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:82
msgid ""
"A failure in post-claim preparation, such as image inspection or manifest"
" validation, still attempts a terminal failure before heartbeat renewal "
"stops, unless the lease was rejected. A failed upload of the final "
"`shared_workspace_settled` notice does not fail a turn that the "
"supervisor and control plane both settled."
msgstr ""
"认领之后的准备工作（例如检查镜像或校验清单）失败时，除非租约已被拒绝，仍会在停止心跳续租之前尝试提交终结性的失败。最后的 "
"`shared_workspace_settled` 通知上传失败，不会让 supervisor 和控制平面都已结算的轮次失败。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:88
msgid ""
"The control plane's admission and settlement receipts are retried **for "
"as long as the lease holds**, with ten-second timeouts and delays "
"doubling from one second to eight, which rides out a recreated control-"
"plane container. A turn the control plane admitted but never saw settle "
"is marked LOST, even if the supervisor settled it. Retries stop when the "
"heartbeat loses the lease, or after a whole lease of failures from a "
"control plane that keeps renewing it; a failed receipt never tears down a"
" session the supervisor settled. Supervisor settlement gets three "
"attempts, five seconds apart. Only transport failures and HTTP 408, 502, "
"503 and 504 are retried; 409 and 410 are final. The prompt is sent "
"exactly once, after its admission acknowledgement."
msgstr ""
"控制平面的准入和结算回执会**在租约有效期间一直重试**，每次超时十秒，间隔从一秒起倍增到八秒，足以撑过控制平面容器被重建。控制平面准入了但从未看到结算的轮次，会被标记为"
" LOST，即使 supervisor "
"已经结算了它。心跳失去租约时，或者控制平面一直在续租、但回执连续失败了整整一个租期时，重试停止；回执失败永远不会拆掉 supervisor "
"已经结算的会话。supervisor 结算最多尝试三次，间隔五秒。只有传输失败和 HTTP 408、502、503、504 会重试；409 和 "
"410 是最终结果。提示词只发送一次，在收到准入确认之后。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:99
msgid ""
"Repeating a settlement returns the recorded boundary for the same live "
"attempt and activation, without moving the workspace epoch or the native "
"turn ordinal. A sandbox manager restart loses its in-memory receipt, so "
"an uncertain completion across a restart fails closed."
msgstr ""
"对同一个仍然存活的 attempt 和激活重复结算，会返回已记录的边界，不会推进工作区 epoch 或原生轮次序号。sandbox manager"
" 重启会丢失内存中的回执，所以跨越重启、无法确定是否完成的情况会以安全方式失败。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:104
msgid "When a retained conversation can continue"
msgstr "保留对话什么时候还能继续"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:106
msgid ""
"A reported preparation failure **before admission** leaves the "
"conversation usable: the runner abandons the activation and reports a "
"failed turn, and the next message resumes the retained native session. "
"That needs a known retained container; a failure before its identity was "
"recorded gives no such proof."
msgstr ""
"**准入之前**已上报的准备失败不会影响对话的使用：runner "
"放弃这次激活，报告轮次失败，下一条消息会恢复保留的原生会话。前提是已知保留容器是哪一个；在记录容器身份之前发生的失败无法提供这样的证明。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:111
msgid ""
"An admission request with no acknowledgement is different. The database "
"may have committed it although the prompt was never sent, so the "
"membership records the job as admitted. `abandon` only releases pre-"
"admission turns (`admitted_job_id IS NULL`), so the terminal transition "
"marks that context LOST. The runner never replays an unconfirmed admitted"
" prompt."
msgstr ""
"没有收到确认的准入请求则不同。即使提示词从未发出，数据库也可能已经提交了它，于是成员记录显示这个任务已准入。`abandon` "
"只释放准入之前的轮次（`admitted_job_id IS NULL`），所以终结状态转换会把那个上下文标记为 LOST。runner "
"永远不会重放未经确认的已准入提示词。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:117
msgid ""
"Recovering after an expired activation or a killed runner would need a "
"further protocol: quarantine the member, fence the old runner's "
"preparation commands and sandbox manager token, verify the exact "
"container and native turn boundary, then resume the session or report it "
"unrecoverable. A sandbox manager `busy=false` is not enough, because "
"workspace setup commands run outside its agent-turn transport. Never "
"requeue a turn just because its admission field is empty, clear a lost "
"flag, or replay an admitted prompt to repair what the UI shows."
msgstr ""
"激活过期或 runner 被杀之后要恢复，还需要另一套协议：隔离这个成员，用栅栏挡住旧 runner 的准备命令和 sandbox manager"
" 令牌，核实确切的容器和原生轮次边界，然后恢复会话或报告无法恢复。sandbox manager 报告 `busy=false` "
"还不够，因为工作区设置命令不经过它的 agent "
"轮次通道。绝不要仅仅因为准入字段为空就把轮次重新排队，也不要清除丢失标记或重放已准入的提示词来修正界面上的显示。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:125
msgid ""
"Owners see plain-language messages for interrupted responses and "
"unavailable conversations; infrastructure details stay in API records and"
" operator logs. LOST memberships stay disabled."
msgstr "对于被打断的回复和不可用的对话，所有者看到的是通俗易懂的提示；基础设施细节只留在 API 记录和运维日志中。处于 LOST 的成员保持禁用。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:129
msgid "The safe release case: a child never accepted its turn"
msgstr "可以安全释放的情况：子进程从没接下这个轮次"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:131
msgid ""
"The host runs each turn in a child process. It releases a claim back to "
"the queue only when it can prove that the child never accepted the turn: "
"the process could not be created, the payload could not be delivered, or "
"the child closed its handover descriptor without accepting, for example "
"after a failed read-only Docker or network preflight. A silent child that"
" is still alive is never released. After acceptance, crashes, kills and "
"lost acknowledgements belong to the lease protocol, and the conversation "
"may become lost rather than repeat the turn."
msgstr ""
"主机在子进程中运行每个轮次。只有能证明子进程从未接受这个轮次时，它才会把认领释放回队列：进程无法创建，负载无法送达，或者子进程没有接受就关闭了交接描述符（例如只读的"
" Docker "
"或网络预检失败之后）。仍然存活但没有回应的子进程永远不会被释放。接受之后，崩溃、被杀和确认丢失都归租约协议处理，对话可能会丢失，而不是重复这个轮次。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:140
msgid ""
"The release is `POST /v1/agent/worker/jobs/<job>/release` with the turn's"
" worker token. The control plane requires the same running attempt and "
"lease generation **and** no membership that admitted the job. The "
"database statement enforces that, so a wrong host observation cannot "
"requeue admitted work."
msgstr ""
"释放使用 `POST /v1/agent/worker/jobs/<job>/release`，并带上这个轮次的 worker "
"令牌。控制平面要求是同一个仍在运行的 attempt "
"和租约代号，**并且**没有任何成员已准入这个任务。这由数据库语句强制执行，所以主机的错误观察无法让已准入的工作重新排队。"

#: ../developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md:145
msgid ""
"Consecutive launch failures stop claims on that host and back off. "
"Heartbeats report `launch_error`, which appears beside the host on Admin "
"→ Servers."
msgstr ""
"连续启动失败时，这台主机会停止认领并逐步拉长重试间隔。心跳会上报 `launch_error`，显示在 Admin → Servers "
"里这台主机的旁边。"

